  "text": "# LARKSPUR ASSURANCE — ONLINE CLAIM FORM\n\n**Claim reference:** CLM-2026-004817\n**Submitted:** 2026-09-24 08:47:19 UTC · Channel: web\n**Policy number:** LRK-TRV-26-0071934\n\n## 1. Claimant\n\n| Field | Detail |\n|---|---|\n| Name | Eleanor Whitcombe |\n| Email | eleanor.whitcombe@example.com |\n| Phone | +44 7700 900418 |\n\n## 2. Trip\n\n| Field | Detail |\n|---|---|\n| Destination | Lisbon, Portugal |\n| Departed UK | 2026-09-12 |\n| Returned UK | 2026-09-19 |\n| Travelling with | Tom Ashdown (partner) |\n\n## 3. What you are claiming for\n\n### Delayed baggage — incident date 2026-09-12\n\nMy suitcase didn't arrive at Lisbon on flight SA1472. The airline delivered it to the hotel the next evening. I had to buy clothes and essentials.\n\n| Line | Description | Date | Amount | Receipt |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | Toiletries (Farmácia Estrela) | 2026-09-12 | EUR 38.40 | FE-2026-118734 |\n| 2 | Clothes - underwear, t-shirts, shorts (Loja Tejo Moda) | 2026-09-12 | EUR 86.50 | LTM 0045-221907 |\n| 3 | Swimsuit and sandals (Cais Beachwear) | 2026-09-13 | EUR 84.90 | CB/13092026/0311 |\n| 4 | Phone charger + adaptor (TecnoBaixa) | 2026-09-13 | EUR 29.99 | TB-77120-4410 |\n| 5 | Pharmacy items - shampoo, toothbrush etc | 2026-09-12 | EUR 38.40 | FE-2026-118734 |\n| 6 | Light jacket (Alfama Linen Co.) | 2026-09-14 | EUR 139.00 | ALC-2026-05582 |\n\n### Personal belongings — incident date 2026-09-15\n\nMy phone was stolen from my beach bag at Praia de Carcavelos while I was nearby. Reported to police the same day.\n\n| Line | Description | Date | Amount | Receipt |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 7 | Apple iPhone 15 128GB (replacement cost) | 2026-09-15 | GBP 649.00 | Original purchase receipt attached |\n\n### Medical expenses — incident date 2026-09-16\n\nI twisted my ankle walking in Sintra and had to go to a clinic. The doctor said to rest for 3 days.\n\n| Line | Description | Date | Amount | Receipt |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 8 | Clinic consultation and X-ray (Clínica Médica Serra Verde) | 2026-09-16 | EUR 185.00 | CMSV-FT 2026/3381 |\n| 9 | Pharmacy - medication and ankle support (Farmácia Central de Sintra) | 2026-09-16 | EUR 42.15 | FCS 2026/A/09921 |\n| 10 | Taxi to clinic | 2026-09-16 | EUR 16.80 | Taxi receipt 1 |\n| 11 | Taxi back to hotel in Lisbon | 2026-09-16 | EUR 41.30 | Taxi receipt 2 |\n\n### Missed excursion — incident date 2026-09-17\n\nWe had a sunset boat trip booked for the 17th which I couldn't go on because of my ankle. The company won't refund.\n\n| Line | Description | Date | Amount | Receipt |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 12 | Tagus sunset cruise (Ribeira Boat Tours) | 2026-09-17 | EUR 120.00 | RBT-48213 |\n\n## 4. Other information\n\n**Total claimed (estimate):** GBP 1380.00\n**Other insurance:** No\n**Compensation received from carrier:** No\n\n## 5. Payment details\n\n| Field | Detail |\n|---|---|\n| Account name | Ms E Whitcombe |\n| Sort code | 20-41-61 |\n| Account number | 53813092 |\n\n## 6. Declaration\n\nI declare that the information I have given is true and complete to the best of my knowledge.\n\nSigned: Eleanor Whitcombe · 2026-09-24 08:47:02 UTC\n\nAttachments uploaded: E01, E02, E03, E04, E05, E06, E07, E08, E09, E10, E11, E13, E14, E15, E16, E17, E18, E19, E20, E21, E22, E23"
