  "text": "# ✈️ Larkspur Travel — Go further, worry less\n\n*Summer 2026 brochure*\n\nWhether it's a city break in Lisbon or a month island-hopping, Larkspur has your back.\n\n## Why travellers love Larkspur\n\n- **Medical cover up to £15 million** — because emergencies don't check the calendar.\n- **Your phone and gadgets protected wherever you go.** Drop it, lose it, someone swipes it — we've got you.\n- **Bag held up? Up to £400** to grab the essentials while the airline catches up.\n- **Missed that sunset cruise?** We'll refund your excursions if illness or injury gets in the way.\n- **Fast claims** — most claims decided in days, not weeks.\n\n## Choose your level\n\n| | Silver | Gold | Platinum |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Medical | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ |\n| Baggage | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ |\n| Gadgets | add-on | add-on | add-on |\n| Excursions | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ |\n\n*\"Larkspur sorted my claim in four days. Brilliant!\" — Sam, Leeds*\n\n---\n\n<small>Cover limits shown are the maximum available across our range. Limits, excesses and exclusions apply and vary by cover level — see the policy wording for full details. This brochure does not form part of your insurance contract. Larkspur Assurance Ltd is a fictional company created for testing purposes.</small>"
